      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Names: Compose calls each\ncontainer <project>-<service>-1,\nand the network and volume\n<project>_<name>.\n\nOn the network, each container\nalso answers to its plain\nservice name: frontend, backend,\ndb.\n\nThe order comes from depends_on\nin compose.yaml.",
      "originalText": "Names: Compose calls each\ncontainer <project>-<service>-1,\nand the network and volume\n<project>_<name>.\n\nOn the network, each container\nalso answers to its plain\nservice name: frontend, backend,\ndb.\n\nThe order comes from depends_on\nin compose.yaml.",
